# libghostty spike (ZEN-40). vendor/ghostty is a pinned submodule (the ghostty
# source); the downloaded Zig toolchain under vendor/ and the built xcframework are
# rebuilt from source and never committed. See docs/libghostty-spike.md.
/vendor/*
!/vendor/ghostty
/Frameworks/GhosttyKit.xcframework/
